<title>USA: GOLF-LEADING SCORES AFTER FIRST ROUND OF BUICK CHALLENGE.</title>
<headline>GOLF-LEADING SCORES AFTER FIRST ROUND OF BUICK CHALLENGE.</headline>
<dateline>PINE MOUNTAIN, Georgia 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scores</p>
<p>after the first round of the $1 million Buick Challenge on</p>
<p>Thursday, played on the 7,057-yard, par-72 Callaway Gardens</p>
<p>course (players U.S. unless stated)</p>
<p>64  Bobby Wadkins</p>
<p>65  Jim McGovern</p>
<p>66  Davis Love, Michael Bradley, Len Mattiace, Olin Browne,</p>
<p>    Stewart Cink</p>
<p>67  Mike Hulbert, Mark Calcavecchia, Lee Janzen, Paul Azinger,</p>
<p>    Billy Ray Brown</p>
<p>68  Don Pooley, Lee Rinker, Steve Elkington (Australia), Brad</p>
<p>    Bryant, Fred Couples, Scott Gump, Guy Boros, Mike Standly, Joe</p>
<p>    Acosta, John Maginnes</p>
<p>Other foreigners:</p>
<p>70  Craig Parry (Australia)</p>
<p>73  Denis Watson (Zimbabwe), Vijay Singh (Fiji)</p>
<p>74  Fulton Allem (South Africa), Stuart Appleby (Australia),</p>
<p>    Lucas Parsons (Australia), Steve Rintoul (Australia)</p>
<p>75  Grant Waite (New Zealand)</p>
<p>76  Jarmo Sandelin (Sweden), Alexander Cejka (Germany)</p>
<p>77  Brad Hughes (Australia)</p>
